#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:1
msgid "3.5 SDK Control Ownership"
msgstr "3.5 SDK控制权归属"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:4
msgid "Control Authority Between SDK and App"
msgstr "SDK与APP控制权问题详解"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:6
msgid "**Principles**"
msgstr "**原则**"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:8
msgid "**1.The App is allowed to preempt the SDK's control authority.**"
msgstr "**1.APP端被允许抢SDK端的控制权；**"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:10
msgid "**2.The SDK is not allowed to preempt the App's control authority.**"
msgstr "**2.SDK端不允许抢APP端的控制权；**"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:12
msgid ""
"Scenario 1: The App Connects First, Followed by the SDK. Control "
"authority is held by the App, and the SDK cannot control the robot."
msgstr "情况1：APP先连接，SDK后连接。控制权在APP端，SDK无法控制。"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:14
msgid "![image](images/APP-Control1.png)"
msgstr "![image](images/APP-Control1.png)"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:14
#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:18
msgid "image"
msgstr "image"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:16
msgid ""
"Scenario 2: The SDK Connects First, Followed by the App. Control "
"authority is held by the SDK. The App cannot control the robot, but it "
"can forcibly preempt the SDK's control authority."
msgstr "情况2：SDK先连接，APP后连接。控制权在SDK端，APP无法控制，但是APP可以强行抢夺SDK控制权。"

#: ../../source/3.5SDK_Control_Ownership.md:18
msgid "![image](images/APP-Control2.png)"
msgstr "![image](images/APP-Control2.png)"

